        "y_or_lat_field.descr": "<xdoc><p>The field in the input table containing the latitude coordinates.</p><p>The <span class=\"esri_uicontrol\">Y Field (latitude)</span> parameter is used when the <span class=\"esri_uicontrol\">Input Coordinate Format</span> parameter is set to <span class=\"esri_uicontrol\">Decimal Degrees - Two Fields</span>, <span class=\"esri_uicontrol\">Degrees and Decimal Minutes - Two Fields</span>, or <span class=\"esri_uicontrol\">Degrees Minutes and Seconds - Two Fields</span>.</p></xdoc>",
        "y_or_lat_field.title": "Y Field (latitude)"
